==Notes==
{{anomaly|Accepting the reward as a secondary ranger teaches Pin Down, which is not taught by any of the expert rangers during the previous quest, instead of [[Power Shot]], which is offered by [[Rakanja]].}}
{{bug|You can abandon this quest after choosing your secondary and before accepting the quest reward and will get a new choice to choose your secondary. However, this will have no effect &mdash; your secondary profession has already been locked.}}
